              "text": "പുഴയുടെ നടുവിൽ അപകടകരമായ ഒരു ചുഴി ഉണ്ട്. puḻayuṭe naṭuvil apakaṭakaramāya oru cuḻi uṇṭŭ. There is a dangerous whirlpool in the middle of the river."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It comes from the same root as ചുഴലുക, to whirl round."
